    <briefdescription>
<para>An animation transition that smoothly interpolates point positions between two datasets. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each point is linearly blended from its old position to its new position. When the point counts differ, the shorter dataset is resampled to match.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1DrawTransition" kindref="compound">DrawTransition</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1DataTransition" kindref="compound">DataTransition</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
